flowchart LR
  GIT[Git commit + PR] --> CI[CI gates]
  CI --> ACR[ACR immutable images]
  ACR --> STAGE[Staging revisions 0%]
  STAGE --> TEST[Health + auth + RLS + outbox + worker + billing]
  TEST --> PROD0[Production candidate 0%]
  PROD0 --> P5[5%]
  P5 --> P25[25%]
  P25 --> P100[100%]
  P5 -. rollback .-> STABLE[Previous stable revision]
  P25 -. rollback .-> STABLE
  P100 -. rollback .-> STABLE
